      "text": {
        "jp": "義賊はコロボス遺跡に逃げたようです。\r\n私たちもこれから追跡に出発します。",
        "official_en": "Some witnesses said that they saw the thief run off to Kolobos Ruins. We were about to go after them ourselves.",
        "real_en": "It looks like the thief fled to the Kolobos Ruins. We're about to head out after them."
      },
