      "text": {
        "jp": "見かけはクールなのにさ。\r\n情に厚くって。\r\nその甘さがラスウェルのいいところだろ。",
        "official_en": "Lasswell. I know behind that cold, steely frown is the <text style=\"italic\">biggest</> softie—and that’s the best thing about you. Don’t let anyone tell you otherwise.",
        "real_en": "You may look cool, but you've got a big heart. That <text style=\"italic\">soft side</> of yours is one of your best qualities, Lasswell."
      },
