      "text": {
        "jp": "言っておくが、私は悪党じゃないぞ。\r\nあくどいことはせず、ちゃんとした事業で稼いだんだ。\r\n義賊に狙われる覚えなどないのに……。",
        "official_en": "Now before you start pointing fingers at <text style=\"italic\">me</>, I’ll have you know that I’ve made my money legitimately, through honest, hard work. I’ve no idea why the noble thief would come after me of all people.",
